*

!fax_frizzle
!fax_frizzle/**/*
!bot.py
!uv.lock
!pyproject.toml

# Tests and their regression baselines are bind-mounted at run time (see the
# test job in .github/workflows/docker-build-push.yaml), never baked in.
fax_frizzle/**/*_test.py
fax_frizzle/**/*_test
fax_frizzle/**/*_test/**

# A local build would otherwise bake in whatever bytecode the host left behind,
# compiled by the host's interpreter rather than the image's.
**/__pycache__
